    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this minimalist puzzle, your objective is simple: <strong>match three cubes of the same color to unlock the next color.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269680/extras/0ae42f802ff7f98439be0906f8594ab3.poster.avif?t=1745877113\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269680/extras/0ae42f802ff7f98439be0906f8594ab3.webm?t=1745877113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269680/extras/0ae42f802ff7f98439be0906f8594ab3.mp4?t=1745877113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t be fooled by the simplicity of the mechanics \u2014 <strong>as you progress, space starts to run out, and you\u2019ll need to be organized and clever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This short game has <strong>no time limit</strong>, allowing you to play at your own pace and relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The total experience lasts around two hours,</strong> making it perfect for a quick session or a relaxing break in a busy day. <i>A Very Simple Puzzle</i> isn\u2019t meant to be a stressful challenge but rather a moment of relaxation and satisfaction, each time you reach a new level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its immediate accessibility makes it <strong>a game for everyone</strong>, appealing to both casual players and puzzle enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you manage to reach the final cube?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Simple concept</strong>: Match three cubes of the same color to unlock new elements and progress in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u231a <strong>Duration</strong>: A complete experience in about two hours, perfect for a short break or a moment of calm between activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Intuitive interface</strong>: A game that's easy to pick up, suitable for all types of players, whether they\u2019re beginners or puzzle fans. Compatible with both keyboard and controller.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this minimalist puzzle, your objective is simple: <strong>match three cubes of the same color to unlock the next color.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269680/extras/0ae42f802ff7f98439be0906f8594ab3.poster.avif?t=1745877113\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269680/extras/0ae42f802ff7f98439be0906f8594ab3.webm?t=1745877113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269680/extras/0ae42f802ff7f98439be0906f8594ab3.mp4?t=1745877113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t be fooled by the simplicity of the mechanics \u2014 <strong>as you progress, space starts to run out, and you\u2019ll need to be organized and clever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This short game has <strong>no time limit</strong>, allowing you to play at your own pace and relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The total experience lasts around two hours,</strong> making it perfect for a quick session or a relaxing break in a busy day. <i>A Very Simple Puzzle</i> isn\u2019t meant to be a stressful challenge but rather a moment of relaxation and satisfaction, each time you reach a new level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its immediate accessibility makes it <strong>a game for everyone</strong>, appealing to both casual players and puzzle enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you manage to reach the final cube?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Simple concept</strong>: Match three cubes of the same color to unlock new elements and progress in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u231a <strong>Duration</strong>: A complete experience in about two hours, perfect for a short break or a moment of calm between activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Intuitive interface</strong>: A game that's easy to pick up, suitable for all types of players, whether they\u2019re beginners or puzzle fans. Compatible with both keyboard and controller.</p>",
    "short_description": "Discover a simple and relaxing solitaire with A Very Simple Puzzle. Match three cubes of the same color to unlock the next one. Can you reach the final cube? With its minimalist aesthetic and laid-back gameplay, this game is perfect for a short, zen break, and can be completed in around two hours.",
